  unavailable: Mm, yes?
  offer: 'You! You came from over there, did you not? Did you see the animals there?
    Yes, yes, the wolves! There is something odd about them, and I intend to investigate
    rather than just putting them down with a spear, and letting two more take the
    scoundrels place. Speaking of "putting down", why do you not go over there and
    fetch me some of their teeth? They would do good for studying! '
  active: Did you find any strange looking fangs yet?
  readyToTurnIn: Ah, brilliant- just what I needed. Here, take these as thanks for
    your help.
  completed: Thank you for helping me!
